This is a [[Secrets and Easter eggs|secret]] location that can be accessed only when defeating Blue in [[Route 22]] the first time. It is possible to permanently miss this trigger due to it being an optional rival fight - Blue disappears from the route after the player defeats [[Gym Leaders#Brock (Pewter City)|Brock]].

The '''Secret Garden''' is accessed by going through the trees on the right side of [[Route 1]], directly below the entrance to [[Viridian City]]. This area can be repeatedly returned to once unlocked.

